    these gaps; each is now closed and pinned by e2e/parity.spec.ts:
    
    - home: real manufacturer wordmark logos (public/brand/wordmarks/),
      testimonial portrait avatars (public/images/avatars/), scroll-reveal
      on the intro section via new Reveal client component (opacity 0 +
