    - footer: Twitter/Facebook/LinkedIn/YouTube icon row + standalone Legal
      section (Privacy/Terms/NMLS) matching the source layout
    - /learn: rebuilt as the source's Learning Center — cream hero, search,
      category filter chips with counts, Featured Guide banner, per-type
      icon cards with Read more, Interactive Tools affordability calculator
      (reuses calculatePayment(); green-mortgage rate discount; mailto
      report), newsletter band (new learn-explorer.tsx client island)
    - /calculator: grouped input sections (Home Details / Loan Terms /
      Taxes & Insurance, 10-30yr chips), sage summary card with stacked
      payment-breakdown bar + legend, Loan Summary rows, PMI alert box,
      How-To icon band, Explore Financing Options, FAQs, Related Resources,
      Popular Resources chips, closing CTA band
    - /get-started: photo-backed hero, numbered step chip + progress bar,
      trust chips at card top, 'Property ZIP code' label + helper text,
      privacy-agreement note, avatar testimonial + proof checkmarks row
    - /modular-home-financing/manufacturers: tier bands with price-range
      sublabels, homeTypes chips + View Models links, All-Manufacturers
      A-Z directory, email CTA
    - assets.spec.ts: 6 -> 14 pinned image assets (wordmarks + avatars)

